# What NOT to ship in the .vsix.
#
# package.json's "files" list governs the npm tarball; this governs `vsce
# package`. Keep the two in step - anything added here that is still in "files"
# ships to npm but not to the Marketplace, and vice versa.
#
# The extension has no runtime dependencies; everything in node_modules is test
# tooling.

src/**
tools/**
test-files/**
.vscode-test/**
build.sh
tsconfig*.json
README.backlog
CLAUDE.dist.md
node_modules/**
*.vsix
out/**/*.map

# Repo furniture that is not part of the extension.
.eslintrc.json
.version-state.json
.beads/**
.claude/**
